{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/623102-changeling-crafting-chimera-question","id":623102,"title":"Changeling: crafting chimera question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-08-10T21:55:56-07:00","id":623102,"title":"Changeling: crafting chimera question","content":"In 2nd edition, p220 said that &quot;Chimera can go above the human maximum of 5 in any Attribute, though one can never have an Attribute higher than its own Glamour raiting&quot;<br /> <br /> I'm hard to get this clearly, is that mean your chimera cannot have Attributes higher than its own Glamour?(so Glamour 2 can only have Attributes limited in 2?)<br /> <br /> Or the only case that the chimera has Traits above 5(Glamour 2 Chimera can have maximum of 7 in one trait)<br /> <br /> And in p223 sample chimera, this spider has 2 on Glamour, but still has Dexterity 4","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6814-rill90","name":"rill90","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-11T05:13:47-07:00","id":623222,"title":"","content":"I've always taken it to mean that chimera are limited by their Glamour rating. A creature with Glamour 2 couldn't have a Trait above two. One with Glamour 7 could have any Trait raised up to a max of seven.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>rill90</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/623102-changeling-crafting-chimera-question#post623102\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And in p223 sample chimera, this spider has 2 on Glamour, but still has Dexterity 4</div> </div> </div> </div>As much as I love Changeling: The Dreaming, it was never known for its consistency.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-11T05:31:08-07:00","id":623227,"title":"","content":"It means 'highest of 5 or the chimera's Glamour rating'. So a Glamour 2 chimera can still have traits in the 0-5 range. But they couldn't get 6+ in a trait unless they have Glamour 6+.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-11T12:53:40-07:00","id":623594,"title":"","content":"Probably as <b>adambeyoncelowe</b> said, but as also <b>PookaKnight</b> said, the books aren't known for consistency. With some lucky, C20 will take are of it a lot better, but until them, just Glamour is too little for the weak ones, but manageable. While 5+Glamour is too much, really.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-11T16:15:31-07:00","id":623734,"title":"","content":"CTD made loads of gaffes like that, but as 0-5 is the usual range, and it specifically points out that they can exceed five (as if the usual limit is five). So I think it's five or Glamour, whichever is higher.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}